<apex:page standardController="Quote" extensions="SteelPipesQuoteController" renderAs="pdf" showHeader="false" sidebar="false" applyBodyTag="false">
    <head>
        <style>
            /* 1. Global page has ZERO margins so covers can stretch to the edges */
            @page {
                size: A4 portrait;
                margin: 0mm;
            }
            
            /* 2. Standard content page handles top/bottom margins, but NO side margins here */
            @page standard-content {
                size: A4 portrait;
                margin-top: 45mm;
                margin-bottom: 35mm;
                margin-left: 0mm; 
                margin-right: 0mm;
                @top-center {
                    content: element(header);
                }
            }
            
            /* 3. Wrap all text inside this to apply the padding/margins safely */
            div.document-body-inner {
                page: standard-content;
                padding-left: 15mm; 
                padding-right: 15mm; 
            }
            
            div.header { position: running(header); text-align: center; width: 100%; }
            body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; }
            
            /* Isolated Data Table CSS (Prevents Borders from bleeding into Terms) */
            table.item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; word-wrap: break-word; }
            table.item-table th, table.item-table td { border: 1px solid black; padding: 4px; text-align: left; font-size: 9px; word-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all; }
            
            .header-text { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
            .bg-green { background-color: #92D050; font-weight: bold; }
            .text-center { text-align: center !important; }
            .text-right { text-align: right !important; }
            .no-border { border: none !important; }
            .bold { font-weight: bold; }
            p { margin: 6px 0; text-align: left; }
            
            /* New Bulletproof Native List for Terms */
            ol.tnc-list {
                margin: 0;
                padding-left: 25px; /* Space for the numbers */
            }
            ol.tnc-list li {
                margin-bottom: 10px;
                text-align: left; /* FIX: Stops massive justification gaps */
                font-size: 11px;
                page-break-inside: auto;
            }
            
            /* 4. Cover Page CSS */
            div.page-cover {
                page-break-after: always;
                width: 210mm;
                height: 297mm;
                margin: 0mm;
            }
            div.page-cover-last {
                page-break-before: always;
                width: 210mm;
                height: 297mm;
                margin: 0mm;
            }
            .cover-img {
                width: 210mm;
                height: 297mm;
                display: block;
                object-fit: cover;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        
        <!-- PAGE 1: FRONT COVER -->
        <div class="page-cover">
            <apex:image url="{!$Resource.SteelPipe1stPage}" styleClass="cover-img"/>
        </div>

        <!-- INNER DOCUMENT: Wraps all your standard content to restore margins -->
        <div class="document-body-inner">
            
            <div class="header">
                <apex:image url="{!$Resource.UtkarshHeader}" style="width: 190mm; height: auto;" alt="Utkarsh Header"/>
            </div>
            
            <!-- REF AND DATE -->
             <table style="width: 85%; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 25px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: left; text-decoration: underline;">REF: {!quoteRecord.Quote_Reference__c}</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; text-decoration: underline;">DATE: {!todayDate}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
            
            <!-- ADDRESS BLOCK -->
            <div>
                <b>TO,</b><br/>
                <b>{!quoteRecord.Account.Name}</b><br/>
                <b>{!companyAddress}</b><br/><br/>
                
                <b>KIND ATTN:</b> <b>{!quoteRecord.Contact.Name}</b> (<b>{!contactNo}</b>)<br/>
                <b>EMAIL ID:</b> <b>{!contactEmail}</b><br/><br/>
                
                <b>SUB:</b>
                <apex:outputText value=" <b>{!subjectLine}</b>" rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(subjectLine))}" escape="false"/>
                <apex:outputText value=" <b>OUR OFFER FOR STEEL PIPES OF BANSAL, UTKARSH BRAND.</b>" rendered="{!ISBLANK(subjectLine)}" escape="false"/><br/>
                <b>Ref:</b> Please refer to your query and the discussion had with us.<br/>
            </div>
            
            <!-- INTRO PARAGRAPHS -->
            <p>
                Your enquiry for supplying of the product as mentioned in the captioned subject has given us this opportunity to connect and introduce our company and the “Bansal, Utkarsh” brand and the various range of products of the company including and not limited to the “MS or GI ERW Pipes”. We are obliged to have got this opportunity to submit our offer and/or quotation for manufacturing and supply of the product described in the captioned subject<apex:outputText value=", as against your enquiry dated <b>{0}</b>" rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(enquiryDate))}" escape="false"><apex:param value="{!enquiryDate}"/></apex:outputText>.
            </p>
            <p>
                We take pride to mention that you have approached one of the leading brands in the country engaged in the manufacturing of the product as described herein and we can assure you that if you decide to accept our offer and place the purchase/supply order in our favor you will always feel proud for having made the right decision by relying upon the best quality product.
            </p>
            <p>
                Our offer and/or quotation for the <apex:outputText value="Core Pipes" rendered="{!isCoreOnly}"/><apex:outputText value="MS ERW Pipes" rendered="{!NOT(isCoreOnly)}"/> “Bansal, Utkarsh” brand as enquired by you is/are more clearly mentioned and recorded in the Annexure “A” to this quotation. The said Annexure “A” shall for all practical purposes be considered as a part of the present quotation.
            </p>
            
            <br/>
            <h3 style="text-align: center; text-decoration: underline;">ANNEXURE A</h3>
            
            <!-- THE TABLE -->
            <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!NOT(isExport)}">
            
            <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(hasStandardPipes, NOT(isCoreOnly))}">
                <table class="item-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 3%;">SL No</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">Pipe / Designation</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size<br/>(mm)</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">Thickness<br/>(mm/Std)</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">End Finish</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">IS Specification</th>
                            <apex:repeat value="{!specialHeaderCols}" var="col">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: {!IF(col == 'Special Description', '9%', '5%')};"><b>{!col}</b></th>
                            </apex:repeat>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Rate per Kg</th>
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Per Unit Price</th>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">QTY</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Quoted Price</th>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showUsanceColumn}">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Usance Interest</th>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Total</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <apex:repeat value="{!standardLineItems}" var="row">
                            <tr style="{!IF(AND(OR(row['uom'] == 'EA', row['uom'] == 'Lot'), NOT(CONTAINS(row['name'], 'Transit Insurance')), NOT(CONTAINS(row['name'], 'Lump Sum'))), 'display: none;', '')}">
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!row['SlNo']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!row['designation']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!row['size_nb']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!IF(ISBLANK(row['display_class_thickness']), '-', row['display_class_thickness'])}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!row['end_finish']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!row['standard_spec_grade']}</b></td>
                                <apex:repeat value="{!row['specialValuesList']}" var="sVal">
                                    <td class="text-center"><b><apex:outputText value="{!sVal}" escape="false"/></b></td>
                                </apex:repeat>
                                <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                                    <td class="text-right">
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!row['uom'] != 'Lump Sum'}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_rate']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!row['uom'] == 'Lump Sum'}"/></b>
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="text-right">
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!row['uom'] != 'Lump Sum'}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_display_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!row['uom'] == 'Lump Sum'}"/></b>
                                    </td>
                                </apex:outputPanel>
                                <td class="text-center">
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!row['quantity']}"/></apex:outputText>&#160;{!IF(row['uom'] == 'Pieces', 'PCS', IF(row['uom'] == 'Meters', 'MTRS', row['uom']))}</b>
                                </td>
                                <td class="text-right"><b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['unitCost']}"/></apex:outputText></b></td>
                                <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showUsanceColumn}">
                                    <td class="text-right">
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!row['usance_interest'] != null}"><apex:param value="{!row['usance_interest']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                        <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!row['usance_interest'] == null}"/></b>
                                    </td>
                                </apex:outputPanel>
                                <td class="text-right"><b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!row['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText></b></td>
                            </tr>
                        </apex:repeat>
                    </tbody>
                    <tbody style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpsumLoading}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Loading Charges (Lump Sum):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpsumLoadingAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPerMtLoading}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Loading Charges (Per MT):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!perMtLoadingAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>

                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpSumFreight}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Lump Sum):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpSumFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPricePerKgFreight}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Price per KG):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!pricePerKgFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>

                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">GST @18%:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalGst}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + specialHeaderCols.size + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Grand Total:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!standardTotalFinal}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </apex:outputPanel>

            <apex:repeat value="{!specialLineItems}" var="spRow">
                <h3 style="text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 15px;">SPECIAL ITEM - <b>{!spRow['customHeader']}</b></h3>
                <table class="item-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 3%;">SL No</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 12%;">Pipe / Designation</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Size<br/>(mm)</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">Thickness<br/>(mm/Std)</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">End Finish</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">IS Specification</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 14%;"><b>{!spRow['customHeader']}</b></th>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Rate per Kg</th>
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 6%;">Per Unit Price</th>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">QTY</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Quoted Price</th>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showUsanceColumn}">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Usance Interest</th>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Total</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr style="{!IF(AND(OR(spRow['uom'] == 'EA', spRow['uom'] == 'Lot'), NOT(CONTAINS(spRow['name'], 'Transit Insurance')), NOT(CONTAINS(spRow['name'], 'Lump Sum'))), 'display: none;', '')}">
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!spRow['SlNo']}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!spRow['designation']}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!spRow['size_nb']}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!IF(ISBLANK(spRow['display_class_thickness']), '-', spRow['display_class_thickness'])}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!spRow['end_finish']}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center"><b>{!spRow['standard_spec_grade']}</b></td>
                            <td class="text-center" style="font-weight: bold;"><b><apex:outputText value="{!spRow['customValue']}" escape="false"/></b></td>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showRateInDocDomestic}">
                                <td class="text-right">
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!spRow['uom'] != 'Lump Sum'}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_rate']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!spRow['uom'] == 'Lump Sum'}"/></b>
                                </td>
                                <td class="text-right">
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!spRow['uom'] != 'Lump Sum'}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_display_unit_price']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!spRow['uom'] == 'Lump Sum'}"/></b>
                                </td>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <td class="text-center">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['quantity']}"/></apex:outputText>&#160;{!IF(spRow['uom'] == 'Pieces', 'PCS', IF(spRow['uom'] == 'Meters', 'MTRS', spRow['uom']))}</b>
                            </td>
                            <td class="text-right"><b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['unitCost']}"/></apex:outputText></b></td>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showUsanceColumn}">
                                <td class="text-right">
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}" rendered="{!spRow['usance_interest'] != null}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['usance_interest']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="-" rendered="{!spRow['usance_interest'] == null}"/></b>
                                </td>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <td class="text-right"><b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText></b></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                    <tbody style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpsumLoading}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Loading Charges (Lump Sum):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpsumLoadingAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPerMtLoading}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Loading Charges (Per MT):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!perMtLoadingAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>

                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showLumpSumFreight}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Lump Sum):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!lumpSumFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!showPricePerKgFreight}" layout="none">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">Freight (Price per KG):</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!pricePerKgFreightAmount}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        </apex:outputPanel>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Sub Total:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_base_total']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold;">GST @18%:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_gst_amount']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="{!8 + IF(showRateInDocDomestic, 2, 0) + IF(showUsanceColumn, 1, 0)}" class="text-right" style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">Grand Total:</td>
                            <td class="text-right" style="width: 9%; font-weight: bold; background-color: #FFFF00;">
                                <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!spRow['pdf_total_price']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </apex:repeat>
            </apex:outputPanel>

            <!-- 👉 CORE PIPES TABLE -->
            <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(coreLineItems.size > 0, NOT(isRegularOnly))}">
                <h3 style="text-decoration: underline; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 15px;">CORE PIPES</h3>
                <table class="item-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr style="background-color: #FFFF00;">
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 4%;">SL No</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 44%;">Pipe Description</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Length (M)</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 8%;">UOM</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 10%;">Quantity</th>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: 9%;">Rate</th>
                            <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!showUsanceColumn}">
                                <th class="text-center" style="width: 7%;">Usance Interest</th>
                            </apex:outputPanel>
                            <th class="text-center" style="width: {!IF(showUsanceColumn, '8%', '15%')};">Total</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <apex:repeat value="{!coreLineItems}" var="cRow">
                            <tr style="{!IF(AND(OR(cRow['uom'] == 'EA', cRow['uom'] == 'Lot'), NOT(CONTAINS(cRow['name'], 'Transit Insurance')), NOT(CONTAINS(cRow['name'], 'Lump Sum'))), 'display: none;', '')}">
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!cRow['SlNo']}</b></td>
                                <td><b>{!cRow['special_description']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!IF(ISBLANK(cRow['pipeLengthDisplay']), '-', cRow['pipeLengthDisplay'])}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center"><b>{!cRow['uom']}</b></td>
                                <td class="text-center">
                                    <b><apex:outputText value="{0, number, #,##0}"><apex:param value="{!cRow['quantity']}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                                </td>
